+# User-point checklist and verification limits
+
+| Requirement | Result/location | Still open |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Review336and337 | All eleven physical pages visually inspected; README page inventory and pinsF01–F05 | 336darkimage content unreliable; source/transmission authentication unperformed |
+| Compare against326,636,637and639 | All four held single pages reinspected; comparison table and pinsF06–F09 | No inferred attachment, receipt, originalintelligence or legalpackage join |
+| Preserve conflicting records and source links | SOURCES records each entity/URL/hash/time; README retains indexlabels, copycontents, earlier reportedassociations, fieldconcern and639caution side by side | No cause or controlling source selected; boundednegativefindings not claims of nonexistence |
+| Keep missing inputs as TODOs | All six DRAFT IDs remain open; referenced report/page7 and actualFrenchreply/source packets explicitly retained | Original eighteencriteria/fivetracks not replaced/completed |
+| Avoid completed searches | Followed two previously unexamined actualindexlinks; priorfour heldsources notredownloaded | Future59B/346/642 titles are routes only; check previousacquisitions before using |
+| Do not count sourcecopies as corroboration | 336cover andworkingcopy repeatrequest; same-investigator/attachmentdependence explicit | No independent historicalcorroboration claimed |
+| Test assumptions and retain contrary evidence | Genre/content controls narrow earlier expectations; actual request and reporteddissemination retained as activeefforts; possibleinnocent/criticalreadings remainuntested | No conspiracy, suppression, substitution or unlawfuldestruction inference established |
+| Exactlocators and readinglimits | PhysicalPDFpages/header/paragraphpins; READMEline references locate ourprose only | No nativeemail/clock/header, translator, hiddenlayer, originalwebsite or legalvalidation |
+| Revisionaccountability | ExactGitadditiondiff supplied; immediateprior reports/TODOs unchanged andhashchecked | Not a nativeemail/draftdiff; pixel/layoutinspection separate |
+| Commit/push new eligiblefindings asAveLyra | Frozen publicderivative excludes rawPDF/rasters/OCR/signatures/ID/contact/passport/privatecase/strategy; exactpaths and identities guarded | Actualpublication/ref/everyfilebody verification recorded afterpush separately; branchpublication is not mainmerge |
+| Respect roles and public/localseparation | Existingnative study; raworiginals onverifiedIntel; no sharedregister/maincase/technicalowner edits | Overview owns subsequent integration; handoffdelivery is not adoption |
+
+No outreach, mailbox access, fees, newrequest/filing, deletion, privatepush, historyrewrite or model/physicaltest. ActualSOURCE-CHECKS validate referencebytes/passivestructure, not historicaltruth. No source was edited to reconcile the observations.
+
+Unpublished review-v1 is preserved. Review-v2 adds clear primary production-page locators and qualifies acquired/read statuses for previously held326/639/939. These are editorial reference/status corrections; raw source values, uncertainty and earlier conflicts are unchanged. EDITORIAL-REVISION.diff gives the exact v1-to-v2 text changes, separate from the current research-file addition diff. README/SOURCES/verification program/check-result bodies are unchanged between those drafts.
+
+The unpublished v2 commit check stopped on whitespace in a generated diff's blank context line. V3 regenerates equivalent zero-context Git patches; the strict whitespace gate remains enabled. Findings, source pins/TODO meanings, source bytes and prior reports are unchanged. The staged v2 draft remains untouched in its original checkout; the corrected candidate uses a separate minimal sparse public checkout. No commit or push was created by that failed attempt.
